+3.1 If $r=0$, $ET$ and $BT$ are the one-point space and $\mathfrak t=0$, so both rings are $\mathbb R$ in degree zero. AC is used only through [F2]–[F5]; no additional arbitrary choice is made in the finite product, the naturality maps, or the generator identification. [A1, F2, F3, F4, F5, step 2.2] ∎
