+$$d_T(P\otimes\alpha)=P\otimes d\alpha-\sum_{i=1}^r(u_iP)\otimes\iota_{X_{e_i}}\alpha,$$
+extended linearly. The tensor $\sum_i u_i\otimes X_{e_i}$ is basis-independent.
+The **Cartan equivariant cohomology** in this item means
+$H^*(C_T(M),d_T)$; the proof below establishes $d_T^2=0$ on $C_T(M)$.
