+---
+id: def-standard-product-torus-as-a-compact-lie-group
+kind: definition
+title: "The standard product torus as a compact Lie group"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 0
