        "statement": "Assume AC and let $T=\\mathbb R/\\mathbb Z$ act trivially on the one-point smooth manifold $\\{\\ast\\}$. Use the period-one tangent generator and its selected degree-two polynomial generator $u$. In the chosen Borel model, $H_T^*(\\{\\ast\\};\\mathbb R)\\cong\\mathbb R[u]$, with $|u|=2$. The Cartan complex is $\\mathbb R[u]$ with zero differential, so its cohomology is also $\\mathbb R[u]$ under the selected coefficient normalization.",
