+
+**Sources read.** Allen Hatcher, *Algebraic Topology*, §3.2, Theorem 3.19,
+printed pp. 221–222, `https://pi.math.cornell.edu/~hatcher/AT/ATch3.pdf`;
+Menzi–Michler, *A Brief Introduction to Equivariant Cohomology*, ETH Zürich
+(2026), Borel-model and Cartan-model passages,
+`https://people.math.ethz.ch/~acannas/Teaching/Moment_Map_2026/Papers/09_Introduction_to_Equivariant_Cohomology.pdf`;
+Qiuyu Ren, *Equivariant de Rham Theory*, §§2.1 and 4.3–4.4,
